{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": -200,
   "width": 2900,
   "height": 220,
   "text": "# Ingest a folder of papers, directed by the Owner and orchestrated by a tier-0 agent\n**Symptom:** The research session found no papers to keep, though all 96 had been read.\n**Root cause:** The ingestion has no step that owns the last hand-off, and no signal when it is missing (OP1).\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `ingestion.spec.yaml`."
  },
  {
   "id": "s",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 70,
   "text": "\u25cf start",
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "a1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**1.** directs the ingestion of E:\\DataManagement into Resource-Library"
  },
  {
   "id": "a2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**2.** attaches the folder to the library"
  },
  {
   "id": "a3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**3.** surveys the folder and proposes a decision per subfolder"
  },
  {
   "id": "d1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 every other root current?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**4.** decides the subfolders that need a person (excludes 11, 12, 13, _external)"
  },
  {
   "id": "x1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 1140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "re-surveys the stale root and re-applies its decisions"
  },
  {
   "id": "a5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 1340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**5.** records the Owner's decisions"
  },
  {
   "id": "d2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 1540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 Clerk qualified in this Core?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 1740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**6.** assesses each remaining subfolder's sensitivity"
  },
  {
   "id": "x2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 1740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "restarts the Cores and re-qualifies the Clerk"
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 1940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 subfolder sensitive?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 2140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**7.** accepts the remaining subfolders by policy"
  },
  {
   "id": "x3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "decides the held subfolder"
  },
  {
   "id": "a8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 2340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**8.** queues the in-scope documents, one accepted subfolder at a time"
  },
  {
   "id": "d4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 2540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 queued count matches the survey?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 2740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**9.** captures and stages each document (intake)"
  },
  {
   "id": "a10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 2940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**10.** approves the staged documents (agent promotion mode)"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 3140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25ac for each approved document, in the Clerk pool",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "a11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 3340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**11.** parses and converts the document page by page"
  },
  {
   "id": "a14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 3340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**14.** tracks spend against the ceiling and reports progress"
  },
  {
   "id": "a12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 3540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**12.** reads it part by part: claims, terms, relations, review"
  },
  {
   "id": "dc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 3540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 spend under the ceiling?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "m1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 3740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "answers each Clerk task"
  },
  {
   "id": "j1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 3740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25ac all documents processed",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "e4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2560,
   "y": 3740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c9 run stopped at the spend ceiling; Owner decides\n*outcome: failure*",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "dm",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1720,
   "y": 3940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 answered in time and in full?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "d5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 3940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 document fully read?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2140,
   "y": 4140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**13.** imports each fully converted paper into the paper graph"
  },
  {
   "id": "x5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 4140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "re-approves the partial document"
  },
  {
   "id": "d6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 4340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 enriched documents accepted?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 4540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**15.** accepts the enriched documents into the library"
  },
  {
   "id": "e2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2560,
   "y": 4540,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c9 papers stay in staging; research finds nothing to keep (OP1)\n*outcome: failure*",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "a16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 4740,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**16.** writes each Source note and validates it is findable"
  },
  {
   "id": "d7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 4940,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c7 findable by title, bottom line and concept?",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "a17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 460,
   "y": 5140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**17.** verifies the counts and labels, and reports to the Owner"
  },
  {
   "id": "e3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2560,
   "y": 5140,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c9 note flagged written-but-not-findable\n*outcome: failure*",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "e1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2560,
   "y": 5340,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "\u25c9 96 findable Source notes; files labelled third_party; papers in the graph\n*outcome: success*",
   "color": "6"
  },
